                                                "example_id": "7913c4ef-c4d7-4018-b9b3-36961c317bcc",
                                                "sense_id": "8a0b3be5-c323-370c-aad0-bff100e9a48b",
                                                "text": "Now counting about 600 homes, it is a place of mythic weekend-long parties and carnal pleasure, a byword for bacchanalia and fleshy hedonism – but also simply a secluded haven where people can be themselves."
                                            }
